CORE
main.py
--unwind 5

^EXIT=10$
^SIGNAL=0$
^VERIFICATION FAILED$
--
^warning: ignoring
--
differential2 §12c soundness. doubled([5])[0] is 10, not 999, so the
assertion must FAIL. Previously the runtime-iterable comprehension was
dropped and the result was nondet/stale, which could let such an
assertion pass vacuously -- the loop lowering makes the value concrete
and the bug is caught.
